flowchart TB
  UI[Streamlit case workbench] --> CSV[(Operational CSV: invoices, PO, receipts, vendors)]
  CSV --> Match[Matching agent: schema, links, Decimal, cumulative capacity]
  Match --> Risk[Risk agent: retained screening and compound assessment]
  Risk --> Critic[Independent critic: separate accounting recomputation]
  Critic --> Gate{Verified and remaining evidence gap?}
  Gate -->|yes; untried tool and budget| Planner[Planner: offline mock or local Ollama]
  Planner --> Allow{JSON contract and tool allowlist}
  Allow -->|invalid or unavailable| Fallback[Visible offline fallback]
  Fallback --> Executor
  Allow -->|valid| Executor[Evidence agent]
  Sources[(Warehouse, procurement and vendor-master adapters)] --> Executor
  Manifest[(Trusted local manifest: pinned SHA-256)] --> Verify[Hash, authority, approval, date and scope checks]
  Executor --> Verify
  Verify -->|accepted| Snapshot[Atomic effective snapshot update; invoice immutable]
  Snapshot --> Match
  Verify -->|missing| Planner
  Verify -->|rejected or conflicting| Hold[Block and request human resolution]
  Gate -->|done, no tool or budget exhausted| Decision[Decision coordinator]
  Hold --> Decision
  Critic -->|one bounded accounting recheck| Match
  Decision --> Outcome{Ready for human review / hold / insufficient data}
  Outcome --> Human[Human review simulation: role, rationale, expected revision]
  Human --> Store[(SQLite cases, snapshots, idempotency and hash-linked events)]
  Decision --> Store
  Store --> UI
  Store --> Recover[Reopen packet only if original source hash matches]
  Recover --> UI
  Human --> Lifecycle[Classify submitted / recorded / inactive with rationale]
  Lifecycle --> Ledger[(Persisted lifecycle overlay: capacity obligations)]
  Ledger --> Match
  Lifecycle --> Invalidate[Invalidate stale recommendations across sessions]
  Invalidate --> UI
  State[(Shared state: source/effective snapshots, findings, evidence, plan, trace)] -.-> Planner
  State -.-> Critic
  Key[(Separate answer key)] --> Evaluation[Tests and scenario comparison only]
  Challenge[(Frozen 25-case development challenge)] --> Evaluation
  Live[Recorded actual local-model requests and responses] --> Evaluation
  Store --> Evaluation
  Evaluation --> Results[Executed validation report]
  Results --> UI
